    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_01",
      "hash64": "B33171C960770553",
      "text": "Hallo! Mein Name ist Ronah und ich bin die\\nInhaberin der Konditorei Mukorossi.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_02",
      "hash64": "B33172C960770706",
      "text": "Oh! Du bist es!\\c\\nSag bloß, du bist der frischgebackene Champ,\\nder gerade in aller Munde ist?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_select_01",
      "hash64": "79B2A1CC9A614F59",
      "text": "Ja, das bin ich!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_select_02",
      "hash64": "79B29ECC9A614A40",
      "text": "Genau, ich bin der neue Champ.",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_03",
      "hash64": "B33173C9607708B9",
      "text": "Juchhu! Ich lag also goldrichtig. Aber du warst\\nja auch sehr stark, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 73,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_04",
      "hash64": "B33174C960770A6C",
      "text": "Meine Leckereien schienen dir damals auch\\ngeschmeckt zu haben...\\c\\nJemand mit so gutem Geschmack muss einfach\\njede Menge Potenzial haben![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 138,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_05",
      "hash64": "B33175C960770C1F",
      "text": "Was sagst du da? Du schaust im Auftrag des\\nTop-Champs bei mir vorbei?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_06",
      "hash64": "B33176C960770DD2",
      "text": "Die Arena-Inspektion...? Oje, die hatte ich ja\\nkomplett vergessen![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 66,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_07",
      "hash64": "B33177C960770F85",
      "text": "Puh, ein Glück, dass ich zufällig gerade hier bin,\\num meinen Mitarbeitern Kuchen vorbeizubringen.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_08",
      "hash64": "B33178C960771138",
      "text": "Gut, dann gib mir doch bitte mal eine Kostprobe\\nvon deiner Stärke als frischgebackener Champ![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_retry",
      "hash64": "E737D6A2FCBCFCE2",
      "text": "Oh? Willst du mir eine Kostprobe von deiner\\nStärke als frischgebackener Champ geben?[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_09",
      "hash64": "B33179C9607712EB",
      "text": "Hihi, das wird ein Spaß! Hier kann man aber nicht\\ngut kämpfen. Gehen wir lieber woanders hin.[VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 93,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0016"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2020_mushi_010_mushi_10",
      "hash64": "B334F6C9607A1D29",
      "text": "Huch, steht dir etwa nicht der Sinn danach?\\c\\nSchau einfach wieder vorbei, wenn du es dir\\nanders überlegst![VAR 0x0114(0016)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
